1. Run `bash scripts/sync_desktop_copy.sh` with unrestricted permissions so it can write under `~/Desktop`.
2. That script rsyncs the repo to `/Users/driffle/Desktop/RAGPredictionGameProject` (keeps `.git`; omits `.venv`, `build`, `dist`, caches) and refreshes `/Users/driffle/Desktop/RAGPredictionGameProject.zip`.
